{
  "note": "Where each font file came from and what was done to it. A test checks that every file listed here is present with the size and sha256 given, that no other woff2 sits beside them, that each family's license is here, and that no font that reserves its name goes out under it.",
  "format": 2,
  "subset": {
    "script": "subset.py",
    "tools": ["fonttools 4.65.0", "brotli 1.2.0"],
    "howTo": "For a file with route subset or renamed-subset: download the file named under source.download, check its sha256 against sourceSha256 (or archiveSha256 for an archive), and run subset.py with python -I on it; a renamed-subset job carries the rename. For route vendor-unmodified there is nothing to run: the file is the one at source.path in the archive, and its sha256 is source.sourceSha256."
  },
